{"seconds": 34.6, "exit": 0, "final": "Qd4+ doesn't win material immediately. Nxe6+ is clearly superior. The main line is:\n\n1. Nxe6+ Kg8 (or Kh8)\n2. Nxc7 - winning the queen\n\n**Best move:** Nxe6+\n\n**Main line:** Nxe6+ Kg8 Nxc7\n\n**Motif:** fork\n\n**Coaching Note (80 words max):**\nThe knight on g5 creates a devastating fork with Nxe6+! This move gives check to the king on g7 while also attacking the queen on c7. Because the queen was the only defender of the e7 knight, it couldn't recapture on e6 without abandoning the e7 square. When the king moves (Kg8 or Kh8), the queen becomes completely undefended and you simply capture it with Nxc7, winning 9 points of material. Look for knight forks that attack multiple pieces and depend on defenders.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Nxe6+\", \"line\": [\"Nxe6+\", \"Kg8\", \"Nxc7\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20", "square": "d2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20", "square": "e1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20", "square": "f1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20", "square": "g5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20", "square": "c7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "r4r2/ppq1npkp/4p1p1/3p2N1/8/8/PPPQ2PP/4RRK1 w - - 2 20", "squa